set.body:
Exercise the executable program path first on families with globally certifiable solutions.

Integrate:
- GPCA ridge, Tikhonov, graph, derivative, spline, and block-smooth quadratic pullbacks;
- multiset quadratic disagreement penalties;
- multiset hard score agreement through verified null-space elimination;
- objective penalties and denominator loadings as distinct programs.

Acceptance:
- direct semantic and lowered objectives agree against dense oracles;
- hard equality residuals satisfy their declared tolerances;
- spectral solutions retain evidenced global-optimum guarantees;
- sparse and matrix-free pullbacks do not densify before an explicit finite solve boundary;
- hard, bounded, and quadratic agreement semantics remain distinct;
- requested and lowered programs plus proofs round-trip through IR;
- JVM and Scala.js pass.
